  "//": "api-vercel's tests are the one directory EXPLICITLY excluded rather than merely unincluded: apps/api-vercel/tsconfig.json ends `exclude: [\"node_modules\", \"dist\", \"test\"]`, so `pnpm -F @ohmail/api-vercel typecheck` covers `src/**` and `app/**` and nothing else - which is why CLAUDE.md's \"four apps typecheck their tests\" overstates it by one.",
